#
# Now move to the middle and check that the translation assembly
# can make small adjustments to its position - the sort of
# adjustments necessary during flexure control. The SAD checks are
# removed so the assembly gets more frequent updates.
#

#
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Move to the middle best focus position
#

